{"ticker":"MCO","updated":"2026-11-20T23:07:41Z","profile":{"longName":"Moody's Corporation","shortName":"Moody's Corporation","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","country":"United States","website":"https://www.moodys.com","fullTimeEmployees":15636,"marketCap":80492732416,"trailingPE":28.48261,"forwardPE":25.101099,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":9.845001,"pegRatio":1.71,"targetMeanPrice":553.6667,"targetHighPrice":600.0,"targetLowPrice":480.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.008,"earningsGrowth":0.178,"grossMargins":0.74633,"operatingMargins":0.46036997,"profitMargins":0.35262,"totalRevenue":8176000000,"beta":1.299,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":546.88,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":402.28,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.87},"summary":"Moody's Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, operates as an integrated risk assessment firm in the United States, the rest of the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through two segments, Moody's Analytics (MA) and Moody's Investors Service (MIS). The MA segment develops a range of products and services that support the risk management activities of institutional participants in financial markets. This segment also offers credit research, credit models and analytics, economic data and models, and structured finance solutions; data sets on companies and securities; and cloud-based SaaS subscription solutions supporting banking, insurance, and know-your-customer workflows. The MIS segment publishes credit ratings and provides assessment services on various debt obligations, programs and facilities, and entities that issue such obligations, including corporate, financial institution, and governmental obligations, as well as structured finance securities. It also provides ratings, investment research, compliance and third-party risk, supplier risk, trade credit, business intelligence sales and marketing, financial and regulatory reporting, balance sheet management, capital management, credit portfolio management, and model risk and governance solutions; Maxsight, a unified risk platform; lending suite, origination, and monitoring sol","summary_zh":"穆迪公司及其子公司作為一家綜合風險評估公司在美國、美洲其他地區、歐洲、中東、非洲和亞太地區運作。它透過穆迪分析 (MA) 和穆迪投資者服務 (MIS) 兩個部門運作。 MA 部門開發一系列產品和服務，支援金融市場機構參與者的風險管理活動。該部門還提供信用研究、信用模型和分析、經濟數據和模型以及結構性融資解決方案；公司和證券的數據集；以及基於雲端的 SaaS 訂閱解決方案，支援銀行、保險和了解客戶工作流程。 MIS部門針對各種債務、計劃和設施以及發行此類債務的實體（包括公司、金融機構和政府債務以及結構性融資證券）發布信用評級並提供評估服務。它還提供評級、投資研究、合規和第三方風險、供應商風險、貿易信貸、商業智慧銷售和行銷、財務和監管報告、資產負債表管理、資本管理、信貸投資組合管理以及模型風險和治理解決方案； Maxsight，統一風險平台；貸款套件、發起和監控解決方案","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"財務數據和證券交易所","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":483.0,"h":490.42,"l":482.5,"c":488.29,"v":1200000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":488.29,"h":489.78,"l":473.93,"c":476.78,"v":947800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":473.73,"h":476.75,"l":469.0,"c":474.8,"v":834200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":474.75,"h":476.79,"l":470.17,"c":472.69,"v":594500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":474.38,"h":479.1,"l":473.13,"c":476.74,"v":520800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":479.84,"h":482.32,"l":477.72,"c":480.82,"v":560300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":479.81,"h":480.78,"l":473.85,"c":476.48,"v":599000},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":477.97,"h":482.92,"l":475.0,"c":479.82,"v":906200},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":475.41,"h":483.82,"l":473.98,"c":482.17,"v":823400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":482.38,"h":488.1,"l":480.22,"c":485.04,"v":716300},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":485.86,"h":488.4,"l":483.34,"c":483.45,"v":859000},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":486.18,"h":489.26,"l":483.86,"c":488.43,"v":923100},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":490.37,"h":494.19,"l":487.28,"c":490.09,"v":807500},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":492.34,"h":495.95,"l":490.84,"c":492.46,"v":644300},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":496.4,"h":496.94,"l":483.74,"c":484.1,"v":1002800},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":486.19,"h":487.91,"l":466.4,"c":473.72,"v":1607800},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":472.13,"h":483.5,"l":471.62,"c":481.25,"v":1080500},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":481.09,"h":486.26,"l":