on","src":"StreetInsider","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"穆迪將豐田前景展望升級為正面，預計息稅前利潤率將小幅擴張"},{"title":"Moody's Raises Toyota Outlook as Automaker Faces Recall","src":"Demokratis.co.id","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE4tUmlBUUh2STFqLUg4Z0RraVpLdk1Td0owa2NWUXAyU1NtYmxLYXBtN09FTWpDeFFBeURSc2R5eTlUVzhQSHdYWExiRk9sc0pWbTJDTEpVVW5pc2lCdUtVYUlHOEVxZ21KU29kUUJsS2x1dHc?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"由於汽車製造商面臨召回，穆迪上調豐田前景"},{"title":"Moody's Upgrades Toyota Outlook as Recall Hits 314029 US Vehicles","src":"Limapagi","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE44RVA4czBjV083RkJ4R0ZzTWlvcmtNaE5QajF1QWthVm1zd1JtTGxMUHJkSHYyWnkyR0hJam52aHBqSG9RV2t3R3h1aktLaDBnZFpBWU5CbUVfUGduRHc3OUJGQnI5X01Gd2FnVmNhVzlSMkhsZkE?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"穆迪上調豐田汽車展望，召回美國汽車 314029 輛"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":5},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1059556/000162828026009136/mco-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"As used in this report, except where the context indicates otherwise, the terms \"Moody's\" or the \"Company\" refer to Moody's Corporation, a Delaware corporation, and its subsidiaries. The Company's executive offices are located at 7 World Trade Center at 250 Greenwich Street, New York, NY 10007 and its telephone number is (212) 553-0300.","zh":"本報告中使用的術語“穆迪”或“公司”，除非上下文另有說明，均指特拉華州穆迪公司及其子公司。該公司的執行辦公室位於 7 World Trade Center at 250 Greenwich Street, New York, NY 10007，電話號碼為 (212) 553-0300。"},{"en":"In a world shaped by increasingly interconnected risks, Moody's data, insights, and innovative technologies help customers develop a holistic view of their world and unlock opportunities. Moody's offerings are distinguished by our vast proprietary and curated data and validated analytical models, which provide the trusted foundation that enable our customers to navigate an increasingly complex risk landscape. Moody's solutions enable the transformation of information into decision-grade intelligence, which is deeply interconnected across risk domains. Moody's also offers valuable insights into financial stability and creditworthiness for organizations, debt instruments, and securities, serving a key role in bringing transparency to the global debt markets. With a rich history of experience in global markets and a diverse workforce of approximately 16,000 across more than 40 countries, Mo","zh":"在風險日益相互關聯的世界中，穆迪的數據、見解和創新技術可幫助客戶全面了解世界並釋放機會。穆迪的產品以我們龐大的專有和精選數據以及經過驗證的分析模型而著稱，這些數據提供了值得信賴的基礎，使我們的客戶能夠應對日益複雜的風險形勢。穆迪的解決方案能夠將資訊轉化為決策級情報，而這種情報在各個風險領域都緊密相連。穆迪也提供有關組織、債務工具和證券的金融穩定性和信用度的寶貴見解，在提高全球債務市場透明度方面發揮關鍵作用。憑藉在全球市場的豐富經驗以及遍布 40 多個國家約 16,000 名多元化員工隊伍，Mo"},{"en":"Moody's is helping customers accelerate value creation in an era of exponential risk by embedding our decision-grade intelligence directly into customer workflows","zh":"穆迪將我們的決策級情報直接嵌入到客戶工作流程中，幫助客戶在指數級風險時代加速價值創造"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"MA competes broadly in the financial information and enterprise risk software industries against various diversified competitors. MA's main competitors within DS are providers of software and analytic solutions. In R&I, MA faces competition from providers of economic data, financial research and analysis. MA's main competitors within D&I are providers of commercial and financial data.","zh":"MA 在金融資訊和企業風險軟體產業中與各種多元化的競爭對手進行廣泛的競爭。 MA 在 DS 內的主要競爭對手是軟體和分析解決方案提供者。在研發方面，MA 面臨來自經濟數據、金融研究和分析提供者的競爭。 MA 在 D&I 內的主要競爭對手是商業和金融數據提供者。"},{"en":"MIS competes with other CRAs and with investment banks and brokerage firms that offer credit opinions and research. Many users of MIS's ratings also have in-house credit research capabilities.","zh":"MIS 與其他信用評等機構以及提供信用意見和研究的投資銀行和經紀公司競爭。 MIS 評級的許多用戶還擁有內部信用研究能力。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Moodys Investors Service","val":4317000000,"zh":"穆迪投資者服務公司"},{"name":"Moodys Analytics","val":3611000000,"zh":"穆迪分析"}],"total":7718000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Recurring Revenue","val":4840000000,"zh":"經常性收入"},{"name":"Transaction Revenue","val":2878000000,"zh":"交易收入"}],"total":7718000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":4171000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":3547000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"EMEA","val":2376000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":699000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Americas","val":472000000,"zh":"美洲"}],"total":7718000000}},"peers":["SPGI","MSCI","MTB","DVA","ICE"]}}